# Languages + countries floor (Gotigin / Domain)

gotigin.com and every Gotigin brand product support the full language
catalogue (**115+ languages**) and **199 countries**.

## Do

- Full catalogue on the company site; packs at `/i18n/<code>.tsv`.
- `lang-nav.js` writes `#l=`; wasm home and account chrome must repaint.
- Local language proof before any Hosting deploy.

## Do not

- Leave a language chip that only sets `html[lang]` with no translated copy.
- Treat the company site as English-only while product sites speak 115+.
